#          a tuple of DOCS keys = one or both terms were confirmed on those documentation pages, fetched 2026-11-17
#          (the chapter link, if any, is where the book treats the concept).
#   index_terms: provider terms added to the alphabetical index, pointing at this table.
# Rule: no row without a chapter or a fetched page behind BOTH cells. "No counterpart found" is a dated search
# result taken from the owning chapter, never a guess. Rows that were considered and left out are listed at the end.
# Never write a | or a straight double quote inside a cell.

