('Usage metering', 'Billing Meters; Metronome (acquired; completed 14 January 2026)', NONE + ' for a meter or usage object; Orb (acquired; closed 1 July 2026) is documented as a separate product', 'On Adyen, counting usage is done outside the payment platform.', ['usage-metering-and-rating'], 'ch', ['Billing Meters (Stripe)', 'Metronome (Stripe)', 'Orb (Adyen)']),
