('Revenue recognition', 'Stripe Revenue Recognition', NONE + ', the help center or adyen.com; Orb documents one for its own product', 'Adyen\'s reports are cash-side records.', ['billing-revenue-recognition'], 'ch', ['Stripe Revenue Recognition']),
('Provider as merchant of record', 'Managed Payments: the customer buys from Link', 'None: “Adyen doesn\'t act as a direct, third-party merchant of record”', 'Stripe excludes Connect platforms from it.', ['merchant-of-record'], 'ch', ['Managed Payments (Stripe)', 'Link (Stripe)']),
